# Claude Code local state. Agent worktrees are full checkouts of this repo
# living inside it — staging them would commit the repo into itself. Settings
# hold machine-specific absolute paths and a credential location, so they stay
# local too. Shared .claude config (skills, agents) is deliberately NOT ignored.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
